# Expense Tracker

A simple web application for tracking income and expenses.

## Features

- Add income
- Add expenses
- View total balance
- View transaction history
- Simple responsive interface

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## How to Run

Download the project and open `index.html` in a web browser.

## Future Improvements

- Add categories
- Add charts
- Save transactions
- Add login
- Add monthly expense reports
